<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3402/07  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5068/78  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.6901/11  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.2705/15  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     31.07/08   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.1110/40  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1505.5/6.5 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     111.35/45  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.6250/50  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.3534/54  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.7889/09  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4005/15  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.8137/44  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7317/27  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6790/00</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$376.10/376.60</p>
